<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://arthurclerjon.github.io/equals/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://arthurclerjon.github.io/equals/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-09-29T12:53:25+00:00</updated><id>https://arthurclerjon.github.io/equals/feed.xml</id><title type="html">EQUALS</title><subtitle>EQUALS (Equitable Allocation of Low-carbon Electricity Sources in a Changing and Resource-limited World) is a 4-year research project funded by the French National Research Agency (ANR) under the Young Researcher (JCJC) programme (2025 call). The project is coordinated by Arthur Clerjon (CEA Liten, Grenoble). &lt;a href=&quot;https://anr.fr/Projet-ANR-25-CE03-5866/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Official ANR page →&lt;/a&gt; </subtitle><entry><title type="html">We convene a breakout group at the Friburg 2026 OPenmod workshop</title><link href="https://arthurclerjon.github.io/equals/blog/2026/openmod/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="We convene a breakout group at the Friburg 2026 OPenmod workshop"/><published>2026-09-28T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-09-28T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://arthurclerjon.github.io/equals/blog/2026/openmod</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://arthurclerjon.github.io/equals/blog/2026/openmod/"><![CDATA[<p>The images in this post are all zoomable, arranged into different mini-galleries using different libraries.</p> <h2 id="lightbox2">Lightbox2</h2> <p><a href="https://cdn.photoswipe.com/photoswipe-demo-images/photos/1/img-2500.jpg" data-lightbox="roadtrip"><img src="https://cdn.photoswipe.com/photoswipe-demo-images/photos/1/img-200.jpg"/></a> <a href="https://cdn.photoswipe.com/photoswipe-demo-images/photos/2/img-2500.jpg" data-lightbox="roadtrip"><img src="https://cdn.photoswipe.com/photoswipe-demo-imag